  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 4802.01 Accountable product/motor fuel",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 4802.01 “Accountable product/motor fuel” means any product which is subject to the reporting requirement of a state, regardless of its intended use or taxability.\n\nSource. #13039, eff 4-20-20",
